  ==> kappa_B = 0.55 +/- 0.17   (dominated by the BULGE mass-to-light ratio; the repository's 0.551 +/- 0.043 held Ups_bul fixed at 0.7)
  a common distance rescaling of 5 and 10 per cent moves the shape-only a0 by 8.4e-11 (fractional) and the standard fit by 22.4% (10 per cent case)
