  deep band g_bar < 0.1 a0 (bulge 0.7): kappa = 0.558 (N 858), 0.492 (N 764), 0.441 (N 688) at Upsilon_disc = 0.5, 0.6, 0.7
     every point, equal weight (no quality cut): 0.444, 0.388, 0.342  <- points with >10% velocity errors pull it down
