  estimator A: correction evaluated at the canonical a0 8.7091e-11; at its own output (fixed point) 8.6533e-11 (-0.64%); selection and correction at the 21% higher alternative a0 9.5263e-11 (+9.4%)
  [PASS] [injection] I4 estimator A is not an echo of the a0 at which its correction is evaluated: iterating to its own output moves it by < 1 per cent, and a 21 per cent change of that a0 moves it by < 10 per cent   (-0.64%, +9.4%)

